sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as AI Client<br/>(OpenAI/Anthropic SDK)
    participant Proxy as Praxis AI<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Classifier as Classifier Filters
    participant StateOwner as state_owner Filter<br/>(Security Class)
    participant Rehydrate as Rehydrate Filter
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / SQLite<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Translate as responses_to_chat_completions
    participant CredInject as credential_inject<br/>(Security Class)
    participant Backend as Inference Backend<br/>(vLLM)
    participant Store as response_store Filter

    Note over Client,Store: Flow 1: OpenAI Responses API (Stateful)
    Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/responses<br/>Bearer Token / API Key
    Proxy->>Classifier: Classify provider: OpenAI<br/>Set x-praxis-ai-* headers
    Classifier->>StateOwner: Extract tenant identity<br/>(tenant_id, issuer, subject)
    StateOwner->>Rehydrate: Lookup previous_response_id
    Rehydrate->>DB: SELECT response by owner<br/>TLS / Connection credentials
    DB-->>Rehydrate: Prior conversation context
    Rehydrate->>Translate: Convert Responses → Chat Completions
    Translate->>CredInject: Inject upstream credentials
    CredInject->>Backend: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>TLS configurable
    Backend-->>Translate: Completion response (SSE stream)
    Translate-->>Store: Convert Chat Completions → Response
    Store->>DB: INSERT response + items<br/>Owner-scoped
    Store-->>Client: SSE streaming response

    Note over Client,Store: Flow 2: Anthropic Messages Translation
    Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/messages<br/>API Key (x-api-key)
    Proxy->>Classifier: Classify provider: Anthropic
    Classifier->>Translate: anthropic_messages_to_chat_completions
    Translate->>CredInject: Inject upstream credentials
    CredInject->>Backend: POST /v1/chat/completions
    Backend-->>Translate: Completion response
    Translate-->>Client: Anthropic Messages SSE stream

    Note over Client,Store: Flow 3: MCP Tool Loop (Agentic)
    Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/responses<br/>(with MCP tools)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Proxy: Iterative tool loop
        Proxy->>Backend: Chat Completion request
        Backend-->>Proxy: tool_call response
        Proxy->>Proxy: openai_mcp_dispatch
        Note right of Proxy: May require approval<br/>(stored in DB)
        Proxy->>Backend: Follow-up with tool result
        Backend-->>Proxy: Final response
    end

    Proxy-->>Client: Aggregated SSE stream
